From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:35:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] D8c: Pay it off fills the statement, not the whole balance

"Pay it off" on /cards filled the card's entire balance, offering to pay
spending the bank has not billed yet. With a statement recorded it now
fills what is left of the latest statement (statement amount less what
has come off the card since, never more than is owed now). With no
statement, or one already settled, it fills the balance as before. The
link still carries rupees, as /transfer reads them.

Test: pay-it-off-statement.test.ts covers no statement, a statement,
part-paid and settled; the existing no-crash test (no statement) holds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
